{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09124","headline":"送章八元秀才擢第往上都应制 · 韦应物","name":"送章八元秀才擢第往上都应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"决胜文场战已酣，行应辟命复才堪。\n旅食不辞游阙下，春衣未换报江南。\n天边宿鸟生归思，关外晴山满夕岚。\n立马欲从何处别，都门杨柳正毵毵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}